Package: PhysioMoCap
Title: Motion Capture and Biomechanics Analysis for PhysioExperiment Objects
Version: 0.6.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Provides motion capture, pose estimation, and biomechanical
    simulation analysis for PhysioExperiment objects. Includes I/O for C3D,
    Venus3D, GaitRec, OpenPose, DeepLabCut, MediaPipe, BVH, ASF/AMC,
    OpenSim, and generic CSV formats. Provides marker tracking (Hungarian algorithm),
    signal filtering, numerical differentiation, resampling,
    center of mass calculation, gait parameters, clinical statistics (ICC, SEM,
    MDC, Bland-Altman), movement phase segmentation, dynamic time warping,
    movement normalization, functional PCA, force-plate kinetics (GRF
    filtering, COP, loading rate, impulse), planar inverse dynamics (joint
    moments/power), EMG integration (rectification, RMS envelope, MVC
    normalization), gait/running/jump task schemas, OpenSim workflow
    integration, and biomechanics-specific visualization.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2),
    PhysioCore
